e duchess might  want another baby more is expected of  her and william as they are stepping up  to the plate as more senior royals  alongside charles and camilla so i've no  doubt that she's broody and of course  her work with young children under five  means that she is always with very very  small children and i think that that  probably does make her very broody but  um i think probably three is the magic  number for the cambridges but never say  never
 

